{"id":773,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"The final factor needed to release this Pokémon’s true power was a strong bond with a Trainer it trusts."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"A solid bond of trust between this Pokémon and its Trainer awakened the strength hidden within Silvally. It can change its type at will."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Through the bond it formed with its Trainer, its will was strengthened, and it was able to destroy its control mask."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"This is its form once it has awakened and evolved. Freed from its heavy mask, its speed is greatly increased."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Although its name was Type: Null at first, the boy who evolved it into this form gave it the name by which it is now known."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Its trust in its partner is what awakens it. This Pokémon is capable of changing its type, a flexibility that is well displayed in battle."}],"abilities":[{"name":"RKS System","hidden":false,"description":"Changes the Pokémon’s type to match the memory disc it holds."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":120,"baseHappiness":0,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":null,"color":"Gray","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":772,"name":"Type: Null","condition":null,"children":[{"id":773,"name":"Silvally","condition":"Level up, High Friendship","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[0,718],[1,33],[1,44],[1,153],[1,184],[1,286],[1,305],[1,332],[1,422],[1,423],[1,424],[1,442],[15,458],[20,319],[25,306],[30,403],[35,161],[40,404],[45,242],[50,36],[55,38],[60,575]],"machine":[403,242,337,203,263,424,53,430,416,258,257,63,304,58,423,196,286,334,442,200,371,182,706,240,156,179,157,496,201,184,120,247,421,214,555,173,211,164,241,57,129,14,422,86,85,161,369,526,404,428],"egg":[],"tutor":[434,519,520,796,805,518]},"cards":[{"id":"me5-95","name":"Silvally","set":"Pitch Black","date":"2026-07-17","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"95","artist":"DOM","small":"https: